# Hexagonal

- `application` depende so de `domain`; ports sao `Protocol`
- Adapters em `infrastructure/adapters`; Settings em `infrastructure/config`
- Composition root (wiring Settings → adapters → use case) **somente** em `presentation`
- Use case sem logs e sem `requests`
- Imports limpos: `from domain...`, `from application...`
- Gate de dependencia no orquestrador (`clean_workspace` stage lint)
- Skill: `mcs-hexagonal-tdd`
